# Digits Reverse Array

## Description
A coding challenge that involves reversing an array of digits.

## Problem Statement
Given an array of digits, reverse the order of the elements in the array.

## Examples

```
35231 => [1,3,2,5,3]
0     => [0]
```

## Solution
See `main.js` for the implementation.

## Approach
The solution converts the number to a string, splits it into individual characters, reverses the array, and maps each character back to a number.

## Usage
```javascript
node main.js
```

## Bonus Challenge
The implementation focuses on conciseness using functional programming techniques.
